<title>POLAND: Polish c.bank rejects all NBP-bill bids at tender.</title>
<headline>Polish c.bank rejects all NBP-bill bids at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland rejected all bids for its 182-day and 273-day NBP-bills after Polish banks bid for 816 million at the central bank's 700 million zloty auction, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
